# Update Room Skills

## Summary
Host command — updates the enabled and disabled skills for a room. Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import UpdateRoomSkillsTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/update-room-skills';

let result = await new UpdateRoomSkillsTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Update).
